    "overview": "Experience ultimate freshness with the Intex Turbo Vent Exhaust Fan, a high-performance ventilation solution designed to keep your kitchen and bathroom free from smoke, odors, and moisture. Engineered with a durable shock and rust-proof body, this fan is built to withstand humid environments while maintaining a sleek, modern look. Its standout auto-shutter and built-in safety grill work together to block external dust and prevent the entry of birds or mice, ensuring a clean and protected interior. Whether you need to clear heavy kitchen fumes or refresh a damp washroom, the Turbo Vent delivers powerful suction with whisper-quiet operation and minimal power consumption. Available in three size - 250mm and compatible with glass, wood, or wall mounting, it offers the perfect blend of versatility, safety, and high-speed air delivery for every home.",
